      "title": "Sparc Electrex Limited Announces Resignation of Ashish Mishra as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective January 24, 2026",
      "body": "Sparc Electrex Limited announced that Mr. Ashish Mishra has tendered his resignation from the post of Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company for better prospects, effective January 24, 2026. The Company has accepted his resignation and he will be relieved from his duties and responsibilities immediately. The Company will ensure the appointment of his successor within the time limits prescribed under the provisions of the Companies Act, 2013 and Listing Regulations and the same shall be intimated to the Stock Exchange(s). Mr. Mishra submitted his resignation letter on January 24, 2026, and confirmed there was no other material reason for his resignation.",
